# Blog post generation script API keys
# You only need ONE of these depending on which provider you use.
#
# OpenAI (default provider, --provider=openai):
# Get yours at: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your-api-key-here

# GLM / Z.AI (use with --provider=glm):
# Get yours at: https://z.ai/manage-apikey/apikey-list
GLM_API_KEY=your-glm-api-key-here

# ─── Daily News Generator ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 100% FREE by default — no API key needed!
# The script fetches RSS feeds (free) and builds articles from the feed content.
#
# To ENHANCE articles with an LLM (optional, uses your existing key above):
#   node scripts/generate-daily-news.mjs --use-llm
#
# For GitHub Actions, add as repository secrets (optional):
#   OPENAI_API_KEY (or GLM_API_KEY)
# If no secrets are set, the workflow runs in free mode automatically.
#
# Usage:
#   node scripts/generate-daily-news.mjs                     # FREE — all topics, no API key
#   node scripts/generate-daily-news.mjs --use-llm           # Enhanced with LLM (needs key)
#   node scripts/generate-daily-news.mjs --topic=ai          # Single topic
#   node scripts/generate-daily-news.mjs --max-per-topic=5   # Limit per topic
#   node scripts/generate-daily-news.mjs --dry-run           # Fetch RSS only, no files saved
#   node scripts/generate-daily-news.mjs --cleanup-only      # Just delete old articles
#
# Articles auto-expire after 14 days (configured in the script as MAX_AGE_DAYS).
